  {
    "name": "query",
    "description": "Read result values for a subset of elements. SINGLE-CALL TERMINAL ACTION.\n\nRequired args:\n- result: string field name (e.g., \"sx\", \"eff_stress\")\n- class_name: element class (e.g., \"brick\", \"shell\")\n- labels: list[int] of element labels, or null for all\n- states: list[int] of state numbers, or null for current state\n\nBehavior: The response returns values directly in `table`. Use those values in your final natural-language reply to the user, then STOP. Do NOT call this tool again for the same query. Do NOT chain additional tool calls after receiving the table \u2014 answer the user immediately.",
    "input_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "result": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "class_name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
